    "Chapter": "即便羁绊一度分道扬镳",
    "Title": "对立",
    "EpisodeDetail": [
        {
            "Id": 150011001,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 1,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "从天而降的失物——“星”坠落后诞生的物质“Stellarium”。",
            "BackgroundImageFileName": "1050",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110010",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150011002,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 2,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "它既是划时代的能源，/n也赋予少数拥有资质的人名为“Sense”的力量。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110020",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150011003,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 3,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "无论善恶……皆是如此。/n于是，才有了我们如今生活的这个世界。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110030",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150011004,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 4,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "绝退帝国声称Stellarium的声音如此宣告，/n不断扩大名为“绝望圈”的统治领域，持续实施暴政。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110040",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150011005,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 5,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "而我所在的奇迹望国，则遵循Stellarium的意志，/n试图解放那些遭受不当统治的人们。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110050",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150011006,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "帝国以所谓Stellarium的声音作为错误解释，施行暴行。/n我的同胞认为，只有推翻这样的帝国，才能真正拯救人民。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110060",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150011007,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150011,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "可是我……我认为，/n首先应该把目光投向眼前正在受苦的人们。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500110070",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
